      "summary_en": "Draven gains increased Move Speed and Attack Speed. The Move Speed bonus decreases rapidly over its duration. Catching a Spinning Axe will refresh the cooldown of Blood Rush.",
      "summary_zh": "德莱文获得移动速度和攻击速度加成。移动速度加成在持续时间过后会急剧下降。在接到一把旋转飞斧后，血性冲刺会立刻冷却完毕。",
