      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Draven hurls two massive axes to deal physical damage to each unit struck. Whirling Death slowly reverses direction and returns to Draven after striking an enemy champion. Draven may also activate this ability while the axes are in flight to cause it to return early. Deals less damage for each unit hit and resets when the axes reverse direction. Executes enemies who have less health than Draven's number of Adoration stacks.",
      "summary_zh": "德莱文掷出两柄大斧，对命中的每个单位造成物理伤害。在命中一名敌方英雄后，大斧会缓慢地调转方向，并回到德莱文身边。在斧头正在向外飞的时候，德莱文可以激活该技能来让斧头早点飞回来。每命中一个单位，伤害值就会减少。在斧头调转方向时，伤害值会重置。会处决那些生命值低于德莱文崇拜层数的敌人们。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307072:4040576"
      ]
    }
